  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "既是苦命人，到处都得受罪。",
      "output_sha256": "2cfaffe10d221f0fb09781cecb623c16c01d8f90e066616fe5adc7fd1a9297bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "2cfaffe10d221f0fb09781cecb623c16c01d8f90e066616fe5adc7fd1a9297bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "穷大奶奶逛青岛，受洋罪；我也正受着这种洋罪。",
      "output_sha256": "574f8a6de30fdb9b974cf0d836aa54d48c4f509c79554ec771041eafa1858702",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "574f8a6de30fdb9b974cf0d836aa54d48c4f509c79554ec771041eafa1858702",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青岛的青山绿水是给诗人预备的，我不是诗人。",
      "output_sha256": "29f73b471e6cf28bce6709da76da6a9b816f6eda670b6c956629a3013efa62e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "29f73b471e6cf28bce6709da76da6a9b816f6eda670b6c956629a3013efa62e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "青岛的洋楼和汽车是为富人准备的，而我口袋里常常只剩下几个铜板。",
      "output_sha256": "d4c831bd9f6ee890fee050eaeb2c37e9a7a0fcab64893f860ecbd566bb148be9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.518626,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f81d281ecf9259011df7a66e25defd1591c436f201c484477a7f845640f70555"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d4c831bd9f6ee890fee050eaeb2c37e9a7a0fcab64893f860ecbd566bb148be9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "享受既然无缘，只好放在一边，单表受罪。",
      "output_sha256": "e4151ea49d51a85cb7e5a80507fc1cc37f93e0fd37029ed8bd309feb2c8fd30f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4151ea49d51a85cb7e5a80507fc1cc37f93e0fd37029ed8bd309feb2c8fd30f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "首先，得提到住房。",
      "output_sha256": "42c458c20347cdaf23b61e4b3bb6eea3d566eb2e05dff8e7bbfa91c477a6512e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.434121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c38c869df6da6a4d9ecc7fd27ae34ce62ebfac200b0451912402ed815183d19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "42c458c20347cdaf23b61e4b3bb6eea3d566eb2e05dff8e7bbfa91c477a6512e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大小不拘，这里的房全是洋式。",
      "output_sha256": "922bc244b0d321c992028b335d36a37c50061fbfcf95c12cf3eb8cddb77b796b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "922bc244b0d321c992028b335d36a37c50061fbfcf95c12cf3eb8cddb77b796b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从房东的角度看，租金并不算高；但对于像我这样的人来说，每月都得辛苦攒钱来付房租。",
      "output_sha256": "6eccc1cd05cc91d297597ebb46347f044d5e4954a3e4a1fdb4330ece857b2018",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.43871,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "98d25e62ceab37a4c3288b2ab61a1b4d7861c8439ce0ddbb1136c09d023c8ab8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6eccc1cd05cc91d297597ebb46347f044d5e4954a3e4a1fdb4330ece857b2018",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "吃的喝的虽不算贵，房子却是贵得离谱。",
      "output_sha256": "765de3d93f8bd42b1b617cf0de75da112dcd7b8deb73fc0c6b6d17a6cec8a9ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.425824,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "582e501e401ea0c8b5b855895fd37940abeb94d7b6bde3364a762c35bbc85ec6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "765de3d93f8bd42b1b617cf0de75da112dcd7b8deb73fc0c6b6d17a6cec8a9ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "由于房价高，很多人只能租一间房，与他人合租。",
      "output_sha256": "1e5fe60b4a3729833b50f4f5511d1d2de119ad6c1e082387251db9ca82288aa5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.385727,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ec13481f86163c85ea6670581992eecc629576d991a632780b7c8150a3332998"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e5fe60b4a3729833b50f4f5511d1d2de119ad6c1e082387251db9ca82288aa5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一层楼里可能有两三间房子都租给不同的人。",
      "output_sha256": "9f4e86f93f687e8b3316a6249b0009089bc2ccef3a83845f8fb31e63dee75a1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.385727,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ec13481f86163c85ea6670581992eecc629576d991a632780b7c8150a3332998"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9f4e86f93f687e8b3316a6249b0009089bc2ccef3a83845f8fb31e63dee75a1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "住在楼上的人得上下跑腿，费煤气，因为高处风大，墙体也不厚。",
      "output_sha256": "fd74410bae37931e81744750a5ef1736a6b090d0229a2a4a6fc9ace0a35ba5f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.657646,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "64616d1eb3cc63cd1489ea2e6fb38f0b6d1e22d9e720926f741d1f5156724e9a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fd74410bae37931e81744750a5ef1736a6b090d0229a2a4a6fc9ace0a35ba5f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而住楼下的人虽然省了力气，感觉暖和一点，但也未必好受。",
      "output_sha256": "2eebd096b5db94ea54e6daba8f75b4493e8eabd0233656b8207acc84bb68cf8f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.451354,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6cc511fb9e78d61dfeba9fe676bf5c27be5bcb692cbf0702bda7055805072c91"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2eebd096b5db94ea54e6daba8f75b4493e8eabd0233656b8207acc84bb68cf8f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "您别看大家都洋服啷当儿的，讲到公德心，青岛的人并不比别处的文明。",
      "output_sha256": "10e5ee20e14f493a5ac69b705163fe4b84a8e98416a936b85e2821b2f97dbe55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "10e5ee20e14f493a5ac69b705163fe4b84a8e98416a936b85e2821b2f97dbe55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "楼房的结构极差，楼板薄如纸，楼上的住户根本不会考虑楼下的情况。",
      "output_sha256": "b3d64f934c25fcc8eb6b6c58ef3e332032be8019bd3f806af4f4b7fcbb372f09",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.37487,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "11e69c82ae83c06a3084b5645a7392dece11e6e90f92aeb073cfa1202746c3d6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b3d64f934c25fcc8eb6b6c58ef3e332032be8019bd3f806af4f4b7fcbb372f09",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "希望大家铺地毯，未免所求过奢；能垫上点席子的便很难得。",
      "output_sha256": "b21996fd41596bed4f71b2a44b00043a4a23f42a8b8e8ecc82826d08f6280e7a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "b21996fd41596bed4f71b2a44b00043a4a23f42a8b8e8ecc82826d08f6280e7a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要赶上楼上有那么七八个孩子，那就蛤蟆垫桌腿儿，死挨。",
      "output_sha256": "aa820ffd0b0365d5370abd83167de2a7392eb09b6502b4ce19be5d1f0dae4488",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa820ffd0b0365d5370abd83167de2a7392eb09b6502b4ce19be5d1f0dae4488",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人家能把楼板跺得老忽闪忽闪的动，时时有塌下来的可能。",
      "output_sha256": "ab6278d8769c4c2a62cd847fcf649c88c8fe6dec9b7659af2de8e0814b1de1ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab6278d8769c4c2a62cd847fcf649c88c8fe6dec9b7659af2de8e0814b1de1ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自然没人能管住小孩不走不跳，可是能够作到的也没人作。",
      "output_sha256": "f05d12622e8d5a902d82be08ef05fd4bba3d60025b3da25ade9d0817237cd7e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "f05d12622e8d5a902d82be08ef05fd4bba3d60025b3da25ade9d0817237cd7e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "比如说椅子腿上包点布，或者不准小孩拉椅子，这很容易办吧？",
      "output_sha256": "e1b273a521fcbc0b5b229281c10989c12bc11fd39817bab3a98e55a631d4284d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1b273a521fcbc0b5b229281c10989c12bc11fd39817bab3a98e55a631d4284d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "哼，没那回事。",
      "output_sha256": "6550cbc01aa78b3cafb932834d9ee4f82ec89a81610135dbf3c2596e27c34ef4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "6550cbc01aa78b3cafb932834d9ee4f82ec89a81610135dbf3c2596e27c34ef4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你莫名其妙楼上怎会有那么多椅子，更不知道为什么老在那儿拉。",
      "output_sha256": "fb802438fde3d90474d4175dc60db89d9d2a8b72a32c4c3eb7e43658436b2d52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb802438fde3d90474d4175dc60db89d9d2a8b72a32c4c3eb7e43658436b2d52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你晓得楼上拉椅子多么难听，它钻脑子，叫人想马上自杀。",
      "output_sha256": "c7ccf9a75e9bc8c9f22be0edca2adabe49048e6bed35092a8a7a238e982b43c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "c7ccf9a75e9bc8c9f22be0edca2adabe49048e6bed35092a8a7a238e982b43c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是谁叫你住楼下呢！",
      "output_sha256": "90ee47b2661b05a35f83a9c2853e528870a39e3e5266af4ae383330eb4b0cd10",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "90ee47b2661b05a35f83a9c2853e528870a39e3e5266af4ae383330eb4b0cd10",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你乘早不用去请求，住楼上的理直气壮。",
      "output_sha256": "8d848658145ce124143edd4b82beec6aec89c35b6149e987867a786bf4e8480e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d848658145ce124143edd4b82beec6aec89c35b6149e987867a786bf4e8480e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“哟，我们的孩子会闹？",
      "output_sha256": "3bd72e9fc181b456db9e0813b0be647094b4e726c9254bdc97e0614526d52ef5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bd72e9fc181b456db9e0813b0be647094b4e726c9254bdc97e0614526d52ef5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那可奇怪！",
      "output_sha256": "8c7be2888b2814dd654500b4a91daeaa3cb3d8830004fc894284fcb991d8bda5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "8c7be2888b2814dd654500b4a91daeaa3cb3d8830004fc894284fcb991d8bda5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "拉椅子？",
      "output_sha256": "9bbcc29a42065e3099f9e671567d5915be6588ae57cc21c7786766193720dd3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "9bbcc29a42065e3099f9e671567d5915be6588ae57cc21c7786766193720dd3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们的小孩就是喜欢拉椅子玩。",
      "output_sha256": "dfd12e4879d7132f37fcd6c5937792c6133915347a5e70938518363bfda1c8b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.879762,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5929a545f7733a4e8a66f7aaf2b3c09a0eb1d4b2a3333772402fb38deeed0142"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dfd12e4879d7132f37fcd6c5937792c6133915347a5e70938518363bfda1c8b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在楼上踢毽？",
      "output_sha256": "8f798ab961134a66da2cae190537ce37d1a8b1232424cc510a1f0648c6f3cf16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f798ab961134a66da2cae190537ce37d1a8b1232424cc510a1f0648c6f3cf16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可不是，小孩还能不玩？”",
      "output_sha256": "c07e73f5b24b6787d96bd3b3f4205c7b235e1282afacbfd25a1f0fbcd10ffd45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "c07e73f5b24b6787d96bd3b3f4205c7b235e1282afacbfd25a1f0fbcd10ffd45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "楼上的人态度和气，根本不觉得有什么不妥。",
      "output_sha256": "d34a61ceecbe8b82677a29d36c1f920c0d18e12bbec9e445d2ef2d3b162b77b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.399747,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "94c018dc52cc68ea0225bf3742031af372014fc8647e4abdc63695b7ab37d881"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d34a61ceecbe8b82677a29d36c1f920c0d18e12bbec9e445d2ef2d3b162b77b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你只有一条路，搬家。",
      "output_sha256": "19756b47b6fd5590b4349dbcb68a3b2ef93e92a07d6fcd9176919c90057094f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "19756b47b6fd5590b4349dbcb68a3b2ef93e92a07d6fcd9176919c90057094f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "搬吧，都调查好了，同楼的小孩少，大人也规矩，你很喜欢。",
      "output_sha256": "3f3c5bfa42784344fe6db187d51c9da3dbb931a2db88b317e6dba8060f66cacd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f3c5bfa42784344fe6db187d51c9da3dbb931a2db88b317e6dba8060f66cacd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "搬过去一看，院里有八条狗！",
      "output_sha256": "1f3cdf71461f31030875e85376d15b741623a2ba6d993876584653029b209321",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f3cdf71461f31030875e85376d15b741623a2ba6d993876584653029b209321",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青岛是带洋派的地方，讲究养狗。",
      "output_sha256": "b172d1b968a8e333b736c44f8ba4535aa6695ce5fb9bac8177faa4c85f78697d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "b172d1b968a8e333b736c44f8ba4535aa6695ce5fb9bac8177faa4c85f78697d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而那些养狗的人却忘了带它们出去溜达，结果狗屎满地都是。",
      "output_sha256": "61c8bf9ddf40ec34fed0c84af04ae24c8452afbaa73faa9e2e1b5651436f7cdb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.385884,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "86dbfbe76bb384e6bbef90ac5f5fc9668fc73679ee4fc155a7b827f5a5f6da90"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "61c8bf9ddf40ec34fed0c84af04ae24c8452afbaa73faa9e2e1b5651436f7cdb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "狗的名字都洋气得很，什么“济美”、“邦走”；显然洋名的狗拉的屎同样臭。",
      "output_sha256": "7f43c39e028da549331e616d61498f25021c6e329ab118574e3a051aac05ea1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.550584,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d36b43bd64836b6b1027a1aedc8353d94da5802526360285be99aecbfdf14f6c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7f43c39e028da549331e616d61498f25021c6e329ab118574e3a051aac05ea1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "济美们还叫呢，要赶上你要睡会儿觉，或是孩子刚睡着，人家才叫得凶呢。",
      "output_sha256": "66a6b0896b40b0c24de086a3db4970bcc401f00c53bda53de2cfa3714850e6c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "66a6b0896b40b0c24de086a3db4970bcc401f00c53bda53de2cfa3714850e6c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "还得搬哪！",
      "output_sha256": "d2c03732ef656e1f3afcc6cfe67ddaf61d6e238c16096cab617a09ac4bc14612",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2c03732ef656e1f3afcc6cfe67ddaf61d6e238c16096cab617a09ac4bc14612",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这回可好，没有小孩，也没有狗。",
      "output_sha256": "30d49a1ec2e825c49006b7a57a93201d4530ba7d69827b56fb0bfd1df06e35c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "30d49a1ec2e825c49006b7a57a93201d4530ba7d69827b56fb0bfd1df06e35c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可是早上七点钟，邻居们开始唱京戏。",
      "output_sha256": "5e5edb4b55992b57b12e828751746f859a68ad457c658212b290751200425b20",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.357787,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "401b8b8899723f81840aabf9f530dfe49921ebb46c9711823d4632b78cf4dda1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e5edb4b55992b57b12e828751746f859a68ad457c658212b290751200425b20",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青岛的京戏最时兴。",
      "output_sha256": "789a9ddcdae65a85d5d571447ccf02f4af8c372f5d0690ff6b9d726eb5a99959",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "789a9ddcdae65a85d5d571447ccf02f4af8c372f5d0690ff6b9d726eb5a99959",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "早晨唱过了，那敢情不过是喊喊嗓子。",
      "output_sha256": "8da0edb600ef6166934a680cf63573318e0d5a38f1eb082a231fe7db1b95ab3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "8da0edb600ef6166934a680cf63573318e0d5a38f1eb082a231fe7db1b95ab3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大轴子是在晚上，胡琴拉着，生末净旦丑俱全，唱开了没头儿。",
      "output_sha256": "e18b5079c7950ceae9243a6accfc1732b64cf4b3ff98b396f9c43b187e7c44b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "e18b5079c7950ceae9243a6accfc1732b64cf4b3ff98b396f9c43b187e7c44b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "好听的当然有，但让人想自杀的也不少。",
      "output_sha256": "d8ac3d74597c6a9e50f8b635f8ac964e66048b70782dc082a27e56b09fd9b263",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.597443,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4ad5da9ec1b219fb118dfda47d9d82eaabc83881485396a8f024d0dbf662724f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8ac3d74597c6a9e50f8b635f8ac964e66048b70782dc082a27e56b09fd9b263",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你怎办？",
      "output_sha256": "e0b0b8174f33670699fba7f7e412d5a92a231f47a7219f1afdd5ef724d337aa3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0b0b8174f33670699fba7f7e412d5a92a231f47a7219f1afdd5ef724d337aa3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "还得搬家。",
      "output_sha256": "d51340d338489c2fb4bc43719205fb31f897358389e5c0e72e1046928115f7d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "d51340d338489c2fb4bc43719205fb31f897358389e5c0e72e1046928115f7d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每次搬家，都要安装灯具，挂窗帘；这可是洋房嘛。",
      "output_sha256": "5011810bbe51573fdaeafe3b3755138ae7bd8b0c52606998ae640d33f40a0e5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.448947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c744df6ef6a2f1bf52b9e61f3a4e6c0c627f4ed475ac036699735d5c49b0c5ec"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5011810bbe51573fdaeafe3b3755138ae7bd8b0c52606998ae640d33f40a0e5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "搬一次家，还得去公司报备水电，真是麻烦。",
      "output_sha256": "54bdd7e465ea02a40f45f0b4326ce73524cb9bc14e95cf4a77f30be8176646d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.41109,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0d270b950495e85a30ccae6d33ca69d8454760e66c2ea5348abcd475827356f1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "54bdd7e465ea02a40f45f0b4326ce73524cb9bc14e95cf4a77f30be8176646d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "搬一回家，要损失一些东西，损失一些钱，洋罪吗。",
      "output_sha256": "0374ecf43cc1d9a1834990185d366d3e3a41e797e230cd449fbe21115726c6f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "0374ecf43cc1d9a1834990185d366d3e3a41e797e230cd449fbe21115726c6f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好房子有哇，也得住得起呀。",
      "output_sha256": "9c9c17258970a8b567d7618b7e479ecc68466ba3a594f8770e3de211f737521f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c9c17258970a8b567d7618b7e479ecc68466ba3a594f8770e3de211f737521f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "算了吧，房子够了。",
      "output_sha256": "4ac6e100e4d1841f4c9620c0e4e5e040fe611fb442e76f33454aa3955fd1b3e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ac6e100e4d1841f4c9620c0e4e5e040fe611fb442e76f33454aa3955fd1b3e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "带洋字的，还就是洋车好，干净，雨布风帘也齐全；可就是贵。",
      "output_sha256": "2903e9093cbd37616e4aec2f959df57033dd148339291468aea6992ce6c001fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "2903e9093cbd37616e4aec2f959df57033dd148339291468aea6992ce6c001fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一上车就得一毛钱，稍微远一点就要两毛。",
      "output_sha256": "30bcc79a847febd6bbfc71894b068f42e31aebee501df0a72c0d186d6809172b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.742584,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c0d9d99366c6753c6b0a4a8e1f305e5cf8e7df59daac62e55192deff1a55e969"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "30bcc79a847febd6bbfc71894b068f42e31aebee501df0a72c0d186d6809172b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我的办法是尽量不坐。",
      "output_sha256": "704d13e54ee2579343674acb97aec43e7a99e93472c6fd517aea62621f4830a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.740972,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9ef7e835c54939d2a0b8337bc1fcf750eea75103a9f2ef17407d64a433bd830"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "704d13e54ee2579343674acb97aec43e7a99e93472c6fd517aea62621f4830a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这有点对不起“车友”们，可是有什么办法呢？",
      "output_sha256": "de50d6f75a91e0d56725a4cf20b38b8d405bf23a4fdf853072bde8aba9ac8482",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "de50d6f75a91e0d56725a4cf20b38b8d405bf23a4fdf853072bde8aba9ac8482",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自行车也不好骑，净是山路，坡得要命。",
      "output_sha256": "0164fd7f5b4d0c92fb4614b35fe63e65570ab5ebd643e8864f8c97dbd9500035",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "0164fd7f5b4d0c92fb4614b35fe63e65570ab5ebd643e8864f8c97dbd9500035",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "最好的办法是坐汽车，其次就是走路。",
      "output_sha256": "90cbb3fa2ad76722ab43525eb5a37db6789fd897402525cbec949c9fc4c6df1d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.703046,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "96dce8796601cc605dd982bc173ad83ad9b3845c66f1386d086aab8d1bd3951d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "90cbb3fa2ad76722ab43525eb5a37db6789fd897402525cbec949c9fc4c6df1d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "以我看，汽车的喇叭我们连买的能力都没有；即使勉强买个喇叭，又得自己走路，干脆走路就好了。",
      "output_sha256": "dc84dd2aa55192850854651e57e9cbb333d15e87062ce4fa6979eee24463e3a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.555533,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4c23b121bfd317ef6f1f22f6f86131ab7573f0c6cf6c9202f7271acd94d09fef"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dc84dd2aa55192850854651e57e9cbb333d15e87062ce4fa6979eee24463e3a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青岛的空气却是不坏，可惜脚受点委屈！",
      "output_sha256": "42f5c364ddc5933c65334b36a4b61b3f093836da28695161f90bcb527da06ff4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "42f5c364ddc5933c65334b36a4b61b3f093836da28695161f90bcb527da06ff4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "关于食，没有什么可说的。",
      "output_sha256": "c634b24b65d40bf8ad3d0a0cdf33b28f8094d4441cd49d5c157158ef53187de8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "c634b24b65d40bf8ad3d0a0cdf33b28f8094d4441cd49d5c157158ef53187de8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "餐馆很多，中餐西餐都有，价格也都还可以，所以我选择消极抵抗，不去外面吃。",
      "output_sha256": "bb3e450b93664e32fd3f4008d482181706e2ba54ebb2e38ca7bc24a1c455223c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.513947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62,
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f3a01c69872ea99fdafdfa2bf4ba1b066ba19dec8bf0415788aa1a694bcf415d",
        "b6ed75ef713a2b168ad347e304a3625a78220484330de4570d9ba1a3ae4e1c60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bb3e450b93664e32fd3f4008d482181706e2ba54ebb2e38ca7bc24a1c455223c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自己家里做菜倒不贵，鱼虾现成，而且新鲜。",
      "output_sha256": "69ea626c059169a745cad9ab53e27b4d750f10679d7aa32157b8d070b3223339",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "69ea626c059169a745cad9ab53e27b4d750f10679d7aa32157b8d070b3223339",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "别的肉类菜蔬也说不上贵来；吃饱了拉倒，这倒好办。",
      "output_sha256": "064c5e29254eb75f2c8be194b5e212f59429162fb9fe72ad646a4372cd5a4267",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "064c5e29254eb75f2c8be194b5e212f59429162fb9fe72ad646a4372cd5a4267",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "馋了呢？",
      "output_sha256": "2aa1739f684df0eca73fe5a6c51520b3cb2d6ed0be9fc342d6742d4ccb3e44a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "2aa1739f684df0eca73fe5a6c51520b3cb2d6ed0be9fc342d6742d4ccb3e44a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "活该！",
      "output_sha256": "c0ed036ccb285f069fa8815e1b50bc61e71e05429afac69da04abb91169738af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "c0ed036ccb285f069fa8815e1b50bc61e71e05429afac69da04abb91169738af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "穿，随便。",
      "output_sha256": "8ff4ce89f59d4acd2adbc043f86f760807ccc8b915ce1488c0b76dab77a822fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ff4ce89f59d4acd2adbc043f86f760807ccc8b915ce1488c0b76dab77a822fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "年轻人多穿洋服，甚至有些穿得很讲究。",
      "output_sha256": "2957ec033ef9cbe63a1b1f60847ab5828f586abf9ef11d473d2c524659aea3fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": 0.664287,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "acf42f025fc1a0d8a84f6efc4f33c93cd8067bd3bb2045443d7e067e689ab5e3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2957ec033ef9cbe63a1b1f60847ab5828f586abf9ef11d473d2c524659aea3fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "咱向来不讲究穿，给它个不在乎。",
      "output_sha256": "0a91b34aae03fd80f5b4c40f53deeb07ffc6e5524ceca97e7d6cda2341bc23c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a91b34aae03fd80f5b4c40f53deeb07ffc6e5524ceca97e7d6cda2341bc23c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这占了已结婚的便宜。",
      "output_sha256": "530785d6a8cd756b79c523dcd4fd0b29e41a0a4120cd22124dc0b46b7431855e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "530785d6a8cd756b79c523dcd4fd0b29e41a0a4120cd22124dc0b46b7431855e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "设若正在“追求”期间，我想我也得多一份洋罪。",
      "output_sha256": "0695efa3ead9c43a24b6a4b27e653be86e55dd1df6d65fc0cda7c3a0627736e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "0695efa3ead9c43a24b6a4b27e653be86e55dd1df6d65fc0cda7c3a0627736e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不穿洋服，可是我天天刮胡子，这一来是耍洋派，二来表示我并不完全不怕太太。",
      "output_sha256": "9e416982ff3c78227fae5e15200fab13b55db81d4a4e4b84f4a96b544251b8c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "9e416982ff3c78227fae5e15200fab13b55db81d4a4e4b84f4a96b544251b8c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "完全不怕太太的人不易发财，真的！",
      "output_sha256": "24a0e7796dc5b309cd78fde47af7bbacf376f718134af5c296f1946f9d2b41dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "24a0e7796dc5b309cd78fde47af7bbacf376f718134af5c296f1946f9d2b41dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说到了玩，此地没有什么游艺场。",
      "output_sha256": "a50a983d161ae1e49fc6535eac178eabec18eb9f175cdb2cc07809f1f8af9913",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_human_sha256": "a50a983d161ae1e49fc6535eac178eabec18eb9f175cdb2cc07809f1f8af9913",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这里本身就是个避暑的地方，成年在这里住，当然是别扭。",
      "output_sha256": "6353d53429a703b3d2cff517960b25f115eaa3500ac17faedf380f046b337749",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.641168,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        76
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7483494681f1669d16d7111e24abe2ba4c16e4466bbd95b93872eefc0daca34"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6353d53429a703b3d2cff517960b25f115eaa3500ac17faedf380f046b337749",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "京戏偶尔会来几个名角，戏票总要两三块，实在不值得去。",
      "output_sha256": "810d68a4053c565d84218a85c7a6433794782271f67dbaef0ae182e21b41f735",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": 0.675336,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        77
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "58741f5d79b3651312d7aedd4ce3fd5a6abf9db75a774bd50a004dfa9fb66680"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_ai_sha256": "810d68a4053c565d84218a85c7a6433794782271f67dbaef0ae182e21b41f735",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        74
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "平日呢，老有蹦蹦戏，听着又不过瘾。",
      "output_sha256": "4f91a94ab3e7b0a7f81dda491f827bec68fb71f1b274b88f31b373592e9c6584",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f91a94ab3e7b0a7f81dda491f827bec68fb71f1b274b88f31b373592e9c6584",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "电影院虽有几处，夏天才会有好片子；冬天的电影只能算是应付，我假装避寒，等到惊蛰再去，也还不迟。",
      "output_sha256": "b4778023057b6bc4fac9b673fb3f5ccd44b8fcbd74298856dfa0566adc521e25",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": 0.668308,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        79
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "014ea74087a3f04db8e6cec0ed474e77f2454367b43892ee0e42598c190de153"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b4778023057b6bc4fac9b673fb3f5ccd44b8fcbd74298856dfa0566adc521e25",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        76
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "公园真好，道路真好，海岸真好，遇上晴天我便去走，既不用花钱，而且接近了自然。",
      "output_sha256": "4c1ade1cd26ac6b8ee2e32b01049a75ece240fbb6dbc28a50f22366c895cf513",
      "alignment_unit_index": 76,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 80,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c1ade1cd26ac6b8ee2e32b01049a75ece240fbb6dbc28a50f22366c895cf513",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在别方面受的罪，由这个享受补过来，这叫做穷欢喜。",
      "output_sha256": "f939c33de6a1dcc2ebb530193cded3b00f772cd5444860ee2fe097d7fb8be02c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 77,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "f939c33de6a1dcc2ebb530193cded3b00f772cd5444860ee2fe097d7fb8be02c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 82,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "总体来看，青岛并不是个坏地方，官员们也确实在努力建设。",
      "output_sha256": "f20291d9311251c72b6dd26ba417d5cf2f66be772ff1850cb8dc13c19b6f4866",
      "alignment_unit_index": 78,
      "alignment_score": 0.640942,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        82
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "635f12edfc65372b8f323c8e298817f7215f4fe6e2f3c7e5315fa45f291014c6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 79,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f20291d9311251c72b6dd26ba417d5cf2f66be772ff1850cb8dc13c19b6f4866",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        79
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 83,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "所谓的洋罪，纯粹是我的问题，穷。",
      "output_sha256": "f007b38334a834516615401401696d1d1ea505441668cc1d38505822e552559d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 79,
      "alignment_score": 0.562478,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        83
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a0c7691bcc91c0f7340109c24f486d41c849cdcb6c3729f09b6e840a2624742"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 80,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f007b38334a834516615401401696d1d1ea505441668cc1d38505822e552559d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 84,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若我一旦发了财，我必定很喜欢这里。",
      "output_sha256": "fbc3d2049efe70ea1c9bc55a95a40a827d5c31ef08eb7426f120d3ea26a490d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 80,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 84,
      "source_human_sha256": "fbc3d2049efe70ea1c9bc55a95a40a827d5c31ef08eb7426f120d3ea26a490d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 85,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等着吧，反正咱不能穷一辈子。",
      "output_sha256": "2c580680bb8dbc807db021af2ad7473257d04a64b51fe50bf1cdd99eacacb856",
      "alignment_unit_index": 81,
      "alignment_score": null,
